      "description": "As a\n Platform Engineer,\nI want\n the non-secret Global-e SCAPI settings (Organization ID, Short Code, Version, Redirect URI, Auth Type) populated per Global-e site,\nso that\n the SCAPI integration between SFCC and Global-e can authenticate and function correctly.\ndata/vendor/globale-metadata/sites/<SiteID>/preferences.xml\n was scaffolded this session for all 4 Global-e sites, following the same pattern as \ndata/vendor/avalara-site-import/sites/ZimmermannAU/preferences.xml\n. \ngeCAPIType=SCAPI\n is already set; the 5 remaining values are commented placeholders pending real values from Global-e onboarding. See \ndocs/Global-e/ocapi-scapi-gap-analysis.md\n.",
