      "description": "As a\n Merchandising Operations user,\nI want\n Global-e order status updates to correctly flow into SFCC even after an order has been exported to OMS,\nso that\n order status stays accurate for customer service and reporting.\nPer the Global-e integration guide, once an order is exported to SFCC OMS its status can no longer be updated the standard way — Global-e's custom hook \nglobale.onGlobaleOrderStatusUpdate\n plus a job processing \ngeReceivedOrderStatusUpdates\n is the documented mechanism. Neither exists yet. This story is conditional on confirming Zimmermann actually uses SFCC OMS for Global-e order fulfillment. See \ndocs/Global-e/main-config-gap-analysis.md\n, Outstanding Item #5.",
