      "description": "As a\n Platform Engineer,\nI want\n the Global-e-required OCAPI Shop API resource permissions correctly granted on all 4 Global-e sites,\nso that\n Global-e's SCAPI/OCAPI calls to SFCC succeed instead of failing with permission errors.\nA corrected, non-stale 17-resource OCAPI JSON is curated at \ndocs/Global-e/ocapi-settings-reference/shop-api-settings.json\n (superseding the stale 6-resource vendor template), but a real SCAPI client ID still needs to be substituted in, and the deployment mechanism (manual BM paste vs. \nzimmermann-sfcc-admin\n sandbox-creation payload vs. potentially \ndata:import:vendor\n — unconfirmed) needs to be decided. See \ndocs/Global-e/ocapi-scapi-gap-analysis.md\n, Outstanding Items #4/#5.",
