      "key": "SFCC-84",
      "summary": "Recently Viewed - See Full History",
      "description": "As a \nShopper, \n\n\nI want\n to see a list of products I've recently browsed,\n\n\nso that\n I can easily return to items I was considering without having to search for them again.\nReference image (Figma is leading):\nThis is a follow-up user story for the page behind the “See Full History” link.",
