{"result":"{
  "id": "18356",
  "key": "SFCC-194",
  "summary": "PDP – Was/Now Sale Price",
  "customfield_10231": {
    "value": "# Given a product has an active sale price, when the PDP renders, then both the original price (Was) and sale price (Now) are displayed with the sale price visually prominent.\n# Given a product has no active sale price, when the PDP renders, then only the standard price is displayed and no Was/Now treatment is applied.\n# Given the shopper is on any storefront, when prices display, then the correct currency and formatting applies for that region.\n# Given a sale price is removed or expired in BM, when the next page render occurs, then the Was/Now display is removed and only the standard price shows."
  },
  "customfield_10232": {
    "value": "\n"
  },
  "customfield_10233": {
    "value": "Link to figma with the desired option: [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=40000855-10042|https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=40000855-10042]"
  }
}"}

